card.statement:
We have the decomposition $\mf g((z^{-1}))=\mf h\oplus\mf h^{\perp}$, where

\begin{equation}
\mf h=\Ker\ad(f+zs)=
\left\{
\begin{pmatrix}
A & zSB\\
B & A
\end{pmatrix}
\Big|
\begin{array}{l}
A,B\in\mf{gl}_n((z^{-1})),\\
\left[S,A\right]=\left[S,B\right]=\tr A=0
\end{array}
\right\}\,,
\end{equation}

and

\begin{equation}
\begin{split}
&\mf h^\perp=\im\ad(f+zs)\\
&=
\left\{\!
\begin{pmatrix}
A+C&-zSB+D\\
B+E&-A+F
\end{pmatrix}
\Bigg|
\begin{array}{l}
A,B,C,D,E,F\in\mf{gl}_n((z^{-1})),\\
\left[S,A\right]=\left[S,B\right]=0,\\
C,D,E,F\in\im\{\ad S:\mf{gl}_n\to\mf{gl}_n\}((z^{-1}))
\end{array}\!\!
\right\}\,.
\end{split}
\end{equation}
